### 2. Initialize `FlatBufferModel` Statically for Fuzzing Throughput

In all four fuzz targets, `tflite::FlatBufferModel::VerifyAndBuildFromBuffer` is currently invoked on every fuzz iteration. Because the model byte arrays are static and fixed, verifying and rebuilding the `FlatBufferModel` on every execution introduces significant performance overhead and reduces fuzzer throughput.

Please initialize the `FlatBufferModel` once as a static variable in each fuzz target:

